34
00:02:38,601 --> 00:02:44,560
In 1922, Raymond Duwalt invented the radial arm woodworking saw.

35
00:02:44,561 --> 00:02:48,600
DeWalt was the first to attach a motor arbor directly

36
00:02:48,601 --> 00:02:49,740
