96
00:05:18,801 --> 00:05:20,720
lathes and drills.

97
00:05:20,721 --> 00:05:24,860
Then came the hand-powered hand brace and hand drill,

98
00:05:24,861 --> 00:05:29,220
which took a lot of manpower and could take hours

99
00:05:29,221 --> 00:05:34,520
