00:12:48,361 --> 00:12:55,000
These guns undergoes such intense use and abuse that they're built with titanium

234
00:12:55,001 --> 00:12:56,460
components inside.

235
00:12:56,461 --> 00:13:07,080
These special tools cost $4,500, and the sockets they use can cost $1,500 each.

236
00:13:07,081 --> 00:13:11,680
They're doing 12-second stops, changing four tires and running all around, and if you're

237
00:13:11,681 --> 00:13:12,680
